## 1. Map your 10 requirements to agents

| #  | Capability                | Agent                         | Backend                  |
| -- | ------------------------- | ----------------------------- | ------------------------ |
| 1  | Hospital/Clinic near me   | **Clinic Finder Agent**       | Location/Maps API        |
| 2  | Clinic open or closed     | **Clinic Availability Agent** | Clinic hours/API         |
| 3  | Doctors list              | **Provider Agent**            | Doctor/Provider API      |
| 4  | VOB booking + scheduling  | **Appointment Agent**         | Scheduling API           |
| 5  | Pet recent visit update   | **Pet Health Agent**          | PetPass/Vet DB           |
| 6  | Last prescription         | **Prescription Agent**        | RX/Prescription API      |
| 7  | Customized recommendation | **Recommendation Agent**      | Pet profile + history    |
| 8  | Search pet items          | **Commerce Agent**            | Product Search API       |
| 9  | Clinic FAQ                | **FAQ/RAG Agent**             | Vector DB/Knowledge Base |
| 10 | Prescription refill       | **RX Refill Agent**           | RX Service               |

I'd actually make **8 specialized agents + 1 orchestrator**, rather than 10 completely independent agents.

