 ├── Vaccination policy
 ├── Cancellation policy
 ├── Payment methods
 ├── Emergency policy
 └── FAQ
```

Store documents in:

```text
Documents
    ↓
Chunking
    ↓
Embeddings
    ↓
Vector DB
    ↓
FAQ Agent
```

Possible stack:

```text
OpenAI Embeddings
       ↓
Pinecone / FAISS
       ↓
Retriever
       ↓
FAQ Agent
```

**User:**

> Does this clinic accept walk-ins?

FAQ Agent retrieves the clinic-specific policy and responds.

