# 11. Prescription refill

This should have **strict transaction controls**.

Conversation:

> **User:** Refill Max's prescription.

Agent:

```text
Prescription Agent
      ↓
Find latest prescription
      ↓
Check refill eligibility
      ↓
RX Service
      ↓
Pharmacy / Clinic rules
      ↓
User confirmation
      ↓
Refill Request API
```

Example:

> Max's prescription has 2 refills remaining. Would you like me to request one refill?

User:

> Yes.

Then:

```text
POST /prescriptions/{id}/refill
```

The API performs the actual operation.

