# 14. Don't make everything an LLM agent

This is **very important for production**.

Use AI for:

```text
Intent detection
Entity extraction
Natural language understanding
Summarization
Recommendation
FAQ/RAG
Conversation
```

Use deterministic services for:

```text
Clinic hours
Distance calculation
Doctor availability
Appointment booking
Prescription lookup
Prescription refill
Payment
Product inventory
Order creation
```

For example:

```text
                    AI
                     │
           "Book Max tomorrow"
                     │
                     ▼
              Intent Agent
                     │
                     ▼
           Appointment Workflow
                     │
        ┌────────────┼────────────┐
        ▼            ▼            ▼
     Clinic API   Doctor API   Schedule API
        │            │            │
        └────────────┼────────────┘
                     ▼
              Available Slots
                     │
                     ▼
              User Confirmation
                     │
                     ▼
                Booking API
```

This gives you much better reliability.

