I'd add a **"Pet Context Memory"** layer:

```text
                 ┌────────────────────┐
                 │   Pet Context      │
                 │      Memory        │
                 └─────────┬──────────┘
                           │
          ┌────────────────┼────────────────┐
          ▼                ▼                ▼
      Pet Profile       Health           Commerce
          │              History           │
          │                │               │
          └────────────────┼───────────────┘
                           ▼
                  Personalized AI
```

So the chatbot understands:

> "Find something for Max."

instead of requiring:

> "Find a dental chew product for my 7-year-old Labrador Max."

That is where your chatbot becomes a **true AI concierge rather than an FAQ bot**.

